# Doors and containers in the Cityguard HQ (3110): open, close, lock, unlock and pick. The east door is closed with
# no key; the west door to the Captain's Office is closed and locked (key 3120). Locksmith carries keys 3120, 3121
# and 3133 and picks every lock; Knocker has no key and no pick lock.
@connect lock
Locksmith
psswrd
@return
@connect knock
Knocker
psswrd
@return
@as lock
open
close
lock
unlock
pick
# Objects come first: "open w" would find the war banner Locksmith carries ("That's not a container."), so doors
# are named in full. "open n" has no exit, "open s" matches the banner too.
open n
open s
open u
open nothing
open east
lock east
unlock east
pick east
@pulse 12
open door
close door
close door
lock east
unlock east
pick east
@pulse 12
open east
open west
@as knock
unlock west
lock west
pick west
@pulse 12
@as lock
unlock west
unlock west
lock west
lock west
pick west
@pulse 12
open west
@state
west
close east
lock east
# The captain (level 17) is more than five levels above Locksmith: too close to the lock.
pick east
@pulse 12
unlock east
open east
east
@as knock
@mob 3060 3110
pick east
@pulse 12
@as lock
# Containers, made from the Captain's safe (3131): closeable with key 3120; open and not closeable; closed with no
# key; closed and not closeable; pickproof and locked. The newest is 1.safe.
@obj 3131 3110 34 1 3120 20 100
@obj 3131 3110 34 0 -1 20 100
@obj 3131 3110 34 5 -1 20 100
@obj 3131 3110 34 4 -1 20 100
@obj 3131 3110 34 15 3123 20 100
open key
close key
lock key
unlock key
pick key
@pulse 12
open 1.safe
unlock 1.safe
lock 1.safe
pick 1.safe
@pulse 12
open 2.safe
close 2.safe
lock 3.safe
unlock 3.safe
pick 3.safe
@pulse 12
close 4.safe
open 4.safe
open 5.safe
close 5.safe
close 5.safe
lock 5.safe
unlock 5.safe
pick 5.safe
@pulse 12
lock 5.safe
lock 5.safe
open 5.safe
pick 5.safe
@pulse 12
unlock 5.safe
unlock 5.safe
open 5.safe
lock 5.safe
unlock 5.safe
pick 5.safe
@pulse 12
@state
